>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">Hi, I'm Shahirul Islam Polak — a DevOps engineer focused on infrastructure automation, cloud deployments, and CI/CD pipelines. I build resilient systems that ship reliably at scale, with experience across the full DevOps lifecycle from provisioning to monitoring.</Text>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">I've been working in DevOps since 2023, gaining hands-on experience with Kubernetes, Ansible, Jenkins, and cloud infrastructure. Currently at SIMEC System Ltd., I manage on-premises Kubernetes clusters, CI/CD pipelines, and production deployments. Outside of work, I'm pursuing AWS and CKA certifications to deepen my cloud and orchestration expertise.</Text>
</Section>
